==== hyperbricks yaml {!{head}} ====
head:
  - type: head
  - css_10:
      - type: css
      - attributes:
          media: screen
      - enclose: <style media="print">|</style>
      - file: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/styles.css
==== explainer ====
A custom <style> tag definition |. Will override extraAttributes.
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HEAD>",
  "Css": null,
  "Favicon": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Items": {
    "@order": [
      "css_10"
    ],
    "css_10": {
      "@type": "<CSS>",
      "attributes": {
        "media": "screen"
      },
      "enclose": "<style media=\"print\">|</style>",
      "file": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/styles.css"
    }
  },
  "Js": null,
  "MetaData": null,
  "Title": ""
}

==== expected output ====
<head><style media="print">
body {
    background-color: red;
}
</style><meta name="generator" content="HyperBricks"></head>
